#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD9701 expect=skipped domain=FA
# Rule:Description: PMDA-SD9701 — the Required key FAOBJ is not populated.
#note "FAOBJ is absent from FA, so Requirements.Variables.All gates the rule to SKIPPED rather than firing on every row. This is the absent-column guard the standing 'absent column = all-missing column' policy makes necessary: without it empty(FAOBJ) would be true on every row of every dataset that simply lacks the column. Asserts the SKIP, not merely the absence of a finding."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset FA
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col FASEQ type=Char
col FATESTCD type=Char
col FATEST type=Char
---
S1      | FA     | S1-001  | 1     | SEV      | Severity
---
